{
  "title": "Gemelo Digital - Red de Sensores DGTIC",
  "uid": "esp32c3-sensores",
  "description": "Monitoreo en tiempo real de la red de nodos ESP32-C3 (BME280/DHT22) - Supercomputo DGTIC",
  "tags": ["produccion", "sensores", "gemelo-digital"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Fuente de datos",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {},
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "nodo",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values({__name__=~\".*_sensor_up\"}, location)", "refId": "nodo" },
        "label": "Nodo",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": ["$__all"] },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Gemelo Digital — Red de Sensores Ambientales\n**DGTIC · Área de Supercómputo** — réplica en vivo de las condiciones físicas de cada nodo (temperatura, humedad, presión y conectividad). Usa el filtro **Nodo** arriba para enfocarte en un activo específico."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Estado y conectividad",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Nodo activo (up)",
      "description": "Si Prometheus logra contactar al nodo por HTTP. CAIDO = sin respuesta de red.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "up{job=~\"bme280|dht22\", nodo=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{nodo}} ({{instance}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "CAIDO", "color": "red" } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Sensor con lectura valida",
      "description": "Si el sensor fisico (BME280/DHT22) esta entregando datos coherentes, mas alla de si el nodo responde por red.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_sensor_up{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_sensor_up{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "SIN LECTURA", "color": "red" } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Alertas activas",
      "description": "Alertas que Prometheus tiene disparadas ahora en cada nodo (temperatura, humedad, presion o sensor sin lectura), evaluadas sobre los valores calibrados.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "count by (location) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname!=\"NodoCaido\", location=~\"$nodo\"}) or 0 * max by (location) ({__name__=~\"(bme280|dht22)_sensor_up\", location=~\"$nodo\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "Normal", "color": "green" } } },
            { "type": "range", "options": { "from": 1, "to": null, "result": { "text": "ALERTA", "color": "red" } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Errores acumulados",
      "description": "Lecturas invalidas acumuladas desde el ultimo arranque del nodo. Sube seguido = revisar cableado/sensor.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_errores_total{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_errores_total{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Condiciones ambientales - tiempo real",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Temperatura (calibrada)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "min": -10,
          "max": 45,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 30 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Humedad relativa (calibrada)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 65 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Presion atmosferica (BME280)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_presion_hpa{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "pressurehpa",
          "min": 650,
          "max": 1100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 700 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1050 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tendencias e historial",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Temperatura (calibrada)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 30 }
            ]
          },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Humedad relativa (calibrada)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 65 }
            ]
          },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Presion atmosferica (BME280)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_presion_hpa{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "pressurehpa" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Punto de rocio (calculado)",
      "description": "Temperatura a la que el aire de la sala empezaria a condensar, calculada con la formula de Magnus a partir de temperatura y humedad calibradas. Dos sensores en el mismo aire deben dar casi el mismo punto de rocio aunque midan distinta humedad relativa: si se separan, alguno esta descalibrado.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "243.12 * (ln(bme280_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / 100) + 17.62 * bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / (243.12 + bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"})) / (17.62 - (ln(bme280_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / 100) + 17.62 * bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / (243.12 + bme280_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "243.12 * (ln(dht22_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / 100) + 17.62 * dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / (243.12 + dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"})) / (17.62 - (ln(dht22_humedad_porcentaje_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / 100) + 17.62 * dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"} / (243.12 + dht22_temperatura_celsius_calibrada{location=~\"$nodo\"})))",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "celsius", "decimals": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Salud de los nodos",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Senal WiFi (RSSI)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "bme280_wifi_rssi_dbm{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "BME280 {{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "dht22_wifi_rssi_dbm{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "DHT22 {{location}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "dBm",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": -80 }
            ]
          },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min", "max", "mean"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Memoria libre (heap)",
      "description": "Si baja de forma sostenida hay una fuga de memoria; por debajo de 20 KB el nodo se reinicia solo. Requiere el firmware con las metricas nodo_*.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "nodo_heap_libre_bytes{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Tiempo encendido",
      "description": "Tiempo desde el ultimo arranque de cada nodo. Requiere el firmware con las metricas nodo_*.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "nodo_uptime_segundos{location=~\"$nodo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "dtdurations", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Reinicios en 24 h",
      "description": "Veces que el nodo arranco en las ultimas 24 horas. Reinicios frecuentes apuntan a alimentacion, WiFi o memoria.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 38 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "resets(nodo_uptime_segundos{location=~\"$nodo\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "{{location}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    }
  ]
}
